From 3443fe70b1f731483f183180d0d533a0f44f98c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:28:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: adapt pinned in-process bridge to exact BCHN host

Use native BCHN context, block/undo storage and immutable admission/removal snapshots. Preserve ordinary transaction IDs, 80-byte headers and CashTokens wrapped script bytes. Keep token-aware indexing, Avalanche, unsupported networks and pruning explicitly unavailable. Native policy and the original Rust indexing implementation remain unchanged.
